# A picture, a PDF, a video and a page sent from alice's other device in a chat of their own (peer createfiles: each
# put up in parts, then the chat made with them; the test chat's end stays as the other flows know it), each opened in
# the preview: the picture read whole through the core and fitted, the PDF's pages drawn by the system, the video
# played by the system's player (a native view under the canvas, its bytes read through the core a part at a time:
# station.file.part), the page in a web view. Back closes each.
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
log do: peer createfiles 预览四个文件 {T} post:收到四个文件 {T} -- e2e-photo.jpg e2e-doc.pdf e2e-clip.mp4 e2e-page.html
timeout 180000
until 预览四个文件 {T}
timeout 60000
wait 1000
tap 预览四个文件 {T}
until =studio
timeout 120000
until img:e2e-photo.jpg
timeout 60000
wait 1000
tap img:e2e-photo.jpg
until %
wait 1500
shot 1-image
back
wait 1500
tap e2e-doc.pdf
wait 5000
shot 2-pdf
back
wait 1500
tap e2e-clip.mp4
until 帧
shot 3a-video-controls
wait 2500
shot 3-video
back
wait 1500
tap e2e-page.html
until 源码
wait 5000
shot 4-page
back
wait 1500
